### Page 4 of 7

```text
Board of County Commissioners
Minutes of the Proceedings - Final
March 4, 2025
Report & Public Petitions
13. Presentation of the FY24 audit of Laramie County.
25 - 096
Laramie County FY24 Financial & Compliance Report
Attachments:
Paul Niedermuller, principal auditor, CliftonLarsonAllen, LLP, presented Laramie
County's audit for fiscal year ending June 30, 2024. Niedermuller said the county
received a clean audit in all matters, and there were no findings.
Commissioner Malm thanked the auditing firm and acknowledged the work of the
clerk's finance office, component units, and staff.
The report was received and filed.
Proclamations
14. Consideration of a resolution proclaiming March 2025 as Red Cross
Month.
25 - 085
Resolution Proclaiming March 2025 as Red Cross
Month
Attachments:
Janet Lewis, Executive Director of the Wyoming Chapter, presented and read the
proclamation.
A motion was made by Vice Chairman Thompson, seconded by
Commissioner Zwonitzer, that this agenda item be approved. The motion
carried by the following vote:
Malm, Thompson, Heath, Zwonitzer
Aye:
Hollingshead
Excused:
